  first | exact @_root_.GlobalTheory.NefRR.hdim_twist_twist_bound | exact _root_.GlobalTheory.NefRR.hdim_twist_twist_bound | (intros; apply _root_.GlobalTheory.NefRR.hdim_twist_twist_bound <;> assumption)
